<p>Channel eldritch forces into a melee attack, hitting the target with your weapon and shield for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">160%, 242%, 321%, 399%, 476%</acronym> arcane damage.</p><p>If either attack hits, the target will be stunned for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 3, 3, 4, 4</acronym> turns and you automatically Block.</p><p>The chance for the attack to stun increases with your Physical Power, but it is considered a magical attack and thus is resisted with spell save, rather than physical save.</p><p>Damage increases with Spellpower.</p>